{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"スピリッツ\n井上氏と日芽香と３人で\nふろがーる！とコラボ表紙です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/03/19/8686654/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱海に行きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/03/19/8686654/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温泉の他にも街を散策し、\n喫茶店やプールや海に行ったり。\n本当に楽しかった〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/03/19/8686654/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海×足湯×コーヒー牛乳\nしあわせのしゅんかん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影後、みんなでお寿司食べました！\nえんがわ！炙りサーモン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身体が信じられないくらい衰えてて\n1日で歩くのが辛くなるくらい\n筋肉痛になりました。。\nなんとかして新しい自分を\n見せられるようにがんばります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/03/19/8686654/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/03/19/8686654/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"in GUAM"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}